  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Small Arms Survey - Human Security Baseline Assesment</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed project is to provide evidence-based information and nuanced analysis for decision- and policy-makers, to bolster the development and implementation of evidence-based policies and programs that support peace-making and state-building in South Sudan. The proposed activities and expected outcomes build upon HSBA&#x2019;s track record of nearly two decades of empirical research on Sudan (2006-present) and South Sudan (2011-present).</narrative>
  </description>
